@startuml

title EduSurvey - Lecturer Create and Publish Course Evaluation

actor Lecturer
participant "EduSurvey" as System
database "Database" as DB

Lecturer -> System: Sign in
System -> DB: Verify credentials and Lecturer role
DB --> System: Authentication result

alt Authentication successful
    System -> DB: Get courses assigned to Lecturer
    DB --> System: Assigned courses
    System --> Lecturer: Display lecturer dashboard\nand assigned courses

    Lecturer -> System: Select assigned course
    Lecturer -> System: Create new evaluation

    System -> DB: Verify Lecturer is assigned\nto selected course
    DB --> System: Course assignment result

    alt Lecturer assigned to course
        System --> Lecturer: Display evaluation form

        Lecturer -> System: Enter title, questions,\nand deadline
        Lecturer -> System: Submit evaluation

        System -> System: Validate evaluation details

        alt Evaluation is valid
            System -> DB: Save evaluation as Draft
            DB --> System: Evaluation saved
            System --> Lecturer: Show evaluation created\n(Response within 3 seconds)

            Lecturer -> System: Publish evaluation
            System -> DB: Update evaluation status to Open
            DB --> System: Status updated
            System --> Lecturer: Show publication confirmation

        else Evaluation is invalid
            System --> Lecturer: Show validation errors
            Lecturer -> System: Correct evaluation details
            Lecturer -> System: Resubmit evaluation

            System -> System: Validate corrected details

            alt Corrected evaluation is valid
                System -> DB: Save evaluation as Draft
                DB --> System: Evaluation saved
                System --> Lecturer: Show evaluation created\n(Response within 3 seconds)
            else Still invalid
                System --> Lecturer: Show validation errors
            end
        end

    else Lecturer not assigned to course
        System --> Lecturer: Access denied
    end

else Authentication failed
    System --> Lecturer: Show sign-in error
end

Lecturer -> System: Sign out
System --> Lecturer: End session and return to login

@enduml